    "Do you want to import {noOfNotesInImport} new notes?": "你要导入 {noOfNotesInImport} 新笔记吗?",
    "Turn on the auto backup and Choose backup folder from below.": "打开自动备份，然后选择下面的备份文件夹.",
    "You were logged out due to extended inactivity. This is to protect your privacy.": "你由于长时间不活动已退出. 这是为了保护你的隐私.",
    "You were locked due to extended inactivity. Enter your passphrase to continue.": "你由于长时间不活动已被锁定，请输入密码继续。",
    "There was no user activity for quite a while. You will be logged off unless you cancel within {countDownTime} seconds.": "用户很长一段时间没有活动. 除非在 {countDownTime} 内取消，否则你将被退出.",
    "There is no way to decrypt these notes without the passphrase. With great security comes the great responsibility of remembering the passphrase!": "没有密码是无法解密这些笔记的。因为有了极大的安全性，那也就有了记住密码口令的重大责任!",
    "If the Notes in your backup file was encrypted with different passphrase then you'll be prompted to enter the passphrase of the device that generated backup.": "如果备份文件中的笔记使用不同的密码口令加密，则会提示您输入生成备份的设备的密码口令.",
    "When turned on, the content on the screen is treated as secure, blocking background snapshots and preventing it from appearing in screenshots or from being viewed on non-secure displays.": "当打开时，屏幕上的内容是安全的，阻止屏幕快照，以防止它出现在屏幕截图中或在非安全显示上被查看.",
    "Passphrase is similar to password but generally longer, it will be used to encrypt and decrypt your notes. Use strong passphrase and make sure to remember it. It is impossible to decrypt your notes without the passphrase. With great security comes the great responsibility of remembering the passphrase!": "密码口令类似于密码，但通常更长，将用于加密和解密您的笔记。使用强密码并确保记住它，没有密码就不可能解密你的笔记。伴随着极大安全性而来的是记住密码的重大责任！",
    "This will create an encrypted local backup, which gets automatically updated every day. Moreover, the backup is designed such that it can be used in tandem with other open-source tools like SyncThing to keep the multiple redundant backups across different devices on the local network.\nTo switch to a new device, you would simply need to copy this backup file to the new device and import that in your new Safe Notes app.\nFor more, see FAQ.": "这将创建一个加密的本地备份，该备份每天都会自动更新。 此外，备份的设计使其可以与其他开源工具（如SyncThing）一起使用，以在本地网络上的不同设备上保留多个冗余备份。\n要切换到新设备，您只需复制此备份文件到新设备并将其导入新的安全笔记App。\n有关详细信息，请参阅常见问题解答。",
